# Trial Balance

## Why it exists

Snapshot check that **Total Debits = Total Credits** as at a date: BS accounts + period P&L (ex GST) in one list. Used before lodgment / year-end packs to catch out-of-balance books.

## As at semantics

Filter = all ledger rows with `date ≤ asAt`. Not “activity in that month only”.

So if the latest transaction is **2026-06-24**:

| As at | Included set | Totals |
|-------|----------------|--------|
| Today (e.g. 2026-08-25) | All current txs | Same |
| 30/06/2026 (FY end) | All current txs | Same |
| 30/06/2027 (future empty FY end) | Still all current txs | **Same** |

Identical totals are **correct** when no later activity exists — not a frozen bug.

## UX bug (learned)

`End of Financial Year (30 Jun)` used **calendar today**’s FY end. In Aug 2026 that is **30/06/2027**, not the reporting FY **30/06/2026**.

**Fix:** pass Reports `reportsFyRange.endDate` into Trial Balance; FY preset prefers that (else FY of latest tx date).

## Do

- Default / FY preset → reporting FY end (e.g. 2026-06-30)
- Note when as-at ≥ latest tx that totals will not change until new activity

## Do not

- Expect As at changes to move totals when all dates are already ≤ every option
- Use empty future FY end as the primary year-end as-at for an earlier statement year
